        "wwcd_body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We design and embroider made-to-order pieces in small batches, so we have flexibility most shops don't. The most common custom requests we hear:</p><ul><li>Brand-new designs from scratch (yours or ours)</li><li>Personalized text, names, credentials, or dates</li><li>Color or material swaps on existing designs</li><li>Sizing outside our standard range, within reason</li></ul><p>Not sure if your idea fits? Reach out anyway. If we can't do it, we'll tell you straight.</p>",
