        "tap_body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Custom projects vary, but here is what's typical:</p><ul><li><strong>Quote turnaround:</strong> 1 to 2 business days.</li><li><strong>Production time:</strong> 2 to 3 weeks from approval, depending on complexity and our current queue.</li><li><strong>Pricing:</strong> depends on design complexity, garment cost, and embroidery time. We'll always give a firm quote before any work starts.</li><li><strong>Final sale:</strong> custom pieces are made specifically for you and can't be returned or refunded. We send mockups for approval so you know exactly what you're getting before we start.</li><li><strong>Rush requests:</strong> possible but not guaranteed. Rush fees apply and depend on workload. See our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shipping Policy</a> for the full picture.</li></ul>",
